  "description": "Add fresh, playful color to your creative projects with this Watercolor Fruit Stripe Pattern Bundle featuring eight unique repeating designs with hand-painted fruit and botanical-inspired motifs arranged in diagonal and linear compositions.\nThe collection combines soft watercolor textures with citrus, tropical fruit, leaves, and decorative organic shapes in fresh green, yellow, orange, and pink tones.\n📦 WHAT’S INCLUDED\n8 unique seamless pattern PNG files\n8 matching tile PNG files for repeating the patterns\n12 × 12 inches\n3600 × 3600 pixels\n300 DPI\nHigh-resolution PNG format\nInstant digital download\n🎨 PERFECT FOR\nFabric & textile printing\nSublimation projects\nT-shirts & apparel\nBags & accessories\nMugs & drinkware\nScrapbooking & digital paper\nWrapping paper & packaging\nWallpapers & backgrounds\nStationery & crafts\nPrint-on-demand projects\n📌 IMPORTANT\nThis is a digital product only. No physical item will be shipped.\nThe included tile files can be repeated to create larger continuous pattern areas. Colors may vary slightly depending on your monitor and printing method.",
